          "contents": "from neighborhood import *\n\n# The Painter starts at (0, 0), facing east.\n# Use this space to write your program based on your sketch!\n# Remember to add comments to explain your plan and what each section of code does.\n\n# Start your code here:\n\n\n# Print the final state for verification\nprint_final_state()\n",
